{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>蛋白粉傷腎？｜向佐自曝食太多蛋白粉腎臟有如70歲老人？營養師澄清：本身患腎病才會傷腎</strong></p><p>・向佐自曝進食過多蛋白粉<br>・向佐稱腎臟如70歲老人<br>・營養師指本身患腎病才傷腎<br>・蛋白粉與腎臟關係需澄清</p><p>暫時未能從am730擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.am730.com.hk/健康/1059592/蛋白粉傷腎-向佐自曝食太多蛋白粉腎臟有如70歲老人-營養師澄清-本身患腎病才會傷腎\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:40.106882+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:17.215613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.629557+00:00","content_hash":"acca6823979a5968962303f0e297015b4f2096c67a630b1d494cf357bed9865d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}